spes graphics: refused IOSurface requests one key per line (0190, diagnostic only).

0189 printed the whole dictionary in one IOLog line; the live log cut it after ~300 characters, right
before the interesting keys. Each key is now its own short line: name, number width and value, or the
class (and count/length) for arrays and data. No behaviour change.

diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetSurface.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetSurface.cpp
index 9237805..fefc857 100644
--- a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetSurface.cpp
